{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Survive. Adapt. Destroy.</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Welcome to <strong>Slug Survival</strong>,\u00a0a <strong>fast, chaotic top-down arena shooter</strong> where every second counts. <br>Face off against bio-engineered slugs that <strong>learn, adapt, and strike harder</strong> with every wave.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4045140/extras/8ce49c325133987328eba16a12ae703d.avif?t=1769147485\" width=920 height=120 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Move fast and <strong>blast through relentless slug swarms</strong> that grow <strong>faster, meaner, and more unpredictable</strong> each round. Keep moving, keep firing or get overrun. <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4045140/extras/c472a5035a2a41a238d739cdfee1fb23.poster.avif?t=1769147485\" width=616 height=310 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4045140/extras/c472a5035a2a41a238d739cdfee1fb23.webm?t=1769147485\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4045140/extras/c472a5035a2a41a238d739cdfee1fb23.mp4?t=1769147485\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4045140/extras/ae6d476a9000af4f7378b35ad43f6334.poster.avif?t=1769147485\" width=616 height=288 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4045140/extras/ae6d476a9000af4f7378b35ad43f6334.webm?t=1769147485\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4045140/ex